' Dovetail lowering path selection + the four generated-rule dispositions.
' Render: plantuml -tsvg 12-fold-path-and-dispositions.puml
@startuml
title Dovetail path selection and the four generated-rule dispositions

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
  DiamondBorderColor #1F2937
  DiamondFontColor #111827
}

|#DBEAFE|Codegen|
start
:`language!` -> `LanguageDef`; <<#DBEAFE>>
if (non-native-output `fold`?\n(`needs_typed_fold_path`)) then (no)
  |#E5E7EB|String path (unchanged)|
  :Lower to `EGraph<String>`\n(byte-for-byte unchanged); <<#E5E7EB>>
  :equations / rewrites -> `RewriteRule<String>`; <<#E5E7EB>>
  stop
else (yes)
  |#EDE9FE|Typed-`L` path|
  :Generate `<Lang>DovetailOp`\n(+ framed `SemanticHash`, `Display`); <<#EDE9FE>>
  :Lower to `EGraph<L>`\n(`__add_<cat>`, lossless leaves); <<#EDE9FE>>
endif

|#EDE9FE|Classify each generated rule|
:`classify_rule`; <<#EDE9FE>>
split
  -[#7C3AED]->
  |#DCFCE7|Lowered|
  :`LoweredAsDovetailRule`\n(structural equation/rewrite\n-> `Pattern -> Pattern`); <<#DCFCE7>>
split again
  -[#7C3AED]->
  |#DCFCE7|Congruence|
  :`SuppliedByEGraphCongruence`\n(auto by `rebuild`); <<#DCFCE7>>
split again
  -[#7C3AED]->
  |#DCFCE7|Native fold|
  :`NativeFoldLowered`\n(`NativeRule<L>` + dispatcher;\nresult via exact-key `add`); <<#DCFCE7>>
split again
  -[#DC2626]->
  |#FEE2E2|Rejected|
  :`RejectedByGeneratedCompiler`\n(host-routed / unlowerable;\nNON-FATAL on the fold path); <<#FEE2E2>>
end split

|#FEF3C7|funding-gated saturation|
:`saturate_with_native`\n(weight ORDERS, never prunes;\nfold-readiness guard defers a fold\nuntil its children are values); <<#FEF3C7>>
:Funded 1-best extraction\nsurfaces the folded normal form; <<#DCFCE7>>
stop

legend right
  |= color |= concept |
  |<#DBEAFE>| GSLT codegen input |
  |<#E5E7EB>| String path (unchanged) |
  |<#EDE9FE>| typed-`L` engine mechanism |
  |<#FEF3C7>| funding |
  |<#DCFCE7>| reduced result / supported disposition |
  |<#FEE2E2>| rejected / non-fatal |
endlegend
@enduml
